<blocks>
  <block id="p0" kind="prose">
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="6">Both end bents | 19 October 2026 (first issued 13 October 2026) | Front strap check; specified side offsets</paragraph>
  </block>
  <block id="p1" kind="prose">
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="6" background="#F1F5FA">Evaluate a straight strap from the FRONT wall on the normal through a nominal pile center. Use the selected alpha in either skew direction. The SIDE walls use a separate specified 24-inch minimum; their strap routing is not evaluated.</paragraph>
  </block>
  <block id="p2" kind="prose">
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="6">Measure to the BACK OF FACING. Pile placement tolerance is excluded by the selected nominal-geometry basis. Reversing skew is permitted for this screen; actual pile locations and the complete strap route require separate coordination.</paragraph>
  </block>
